{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 1,
  "name": "rgb_breath",
  "index": 1,
  "play_loop": -1,
  "maxF": 0,
  "mapping": "matrix",
  "white": 0,
  "_comment": [
    "RGB 呼吸：三個通道各自一條正弦（phi 相隔 120°），所以顏色繞色環、亮度唔會爆閃。",
    "write 只寫自己嗰個通道（r/g/b），三項疊在同一組 group 上，各寫各的。"
  ],
  "map": [
    { "group": "matrix.full", "effect": "breath_r", "write": "r" },
    { "group": "matrix.full", "effect": "breath_g", "write": "g" },
    { "group": "matrix.full", "effect": "breath_b", "write": "b" }
  ]
}
